{"unit_id":"dat-lequoc__dsh-opinionated-subagent#feature-model-route","repo":"dat-lequoc/dsh-opinionated-subagent","commit":"cadfaeff4d9a42b4630c6a1a0265bd09cfed232d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-model 的功能「子 agent 模型白名单」：委派工具要求调用方选择已配置的 provider/model 路线，并把选定路线传给新子 agent；用户可在设置中维护允许列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/spawn.js:18-25","lib/spawn.js:177-224"]}
