{"unit_id":"dat-lequoc__dsh-opinionated-subagent#feature-steer","repo":"dat-lequoc/dsh-opinionated-subagent","commit":"cadfaeff4d9a42b4630c6a1a0265bd09cfed232d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-model 的功能「下一步纠正运行中的子 agent」：调用 send_message 向正在运行的直接子 agent 投递消息，使其在下一步边界接收；其他状态交由原生服务处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/control.js:1-8","lib/control.js:42-77"]}
